  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Business Plans for the Use of Electrical Energy Storage Systems (EESS) in the Republic of Belarus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a comprehensive initiative aimed at supporting the preparation of three feasibility studies for industrial and energy companies, as well as those owning electric charging infrastructure for transport, the development of business plans based on the feasibility studies, tailored to specific company conditions, and the creation of institutional conditions for the simultaneous mass implementation of industrial energy storage systems in the energy infrastructure of the Republic of Bela</narrative>
  </description>
